### Download market data history - fake client
POST {{bffBaseUrl}}/api/market-data/history/download
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": {
    "symbol": "BIO",
    "exchange": "NYSE"
  },
  "timeframe": "1Day",
  "start": "2024-01-01",
  "end": "2026-07-05",
  "adjustment": "split"
}
